Subject: [PATCH 1/4] feat(research): derive research-stack focus tags and
 verify focus addenda

Mirror research-stack v3's focus-tag manifest (research-stack/focus/tags.json)
as RESEARCH_FOCUS_MAP and use it in three places:

- research_focus_for(pathways, overlays) derives up to 4 tags from a work
  item's itinerary and risk overlays (overlay matches weighted x2, the
  generic research pathway never triggers a tag).
- pathway-next renders the derived tags on the research card at render time:
  "/research-stack --deep --focus security,devtools,..." in the skill and
  best-execution stack. PATHWAY_DOCTRINE stays static.
- research-v1 verifier: a dossier with frontmatter `focus:` must carry a
  heading or bold lead-in for each tag's addendum; unknown tags fail.

Document the mapping and the rs-<tag>-<slug> coverage-gap finding convention
(routes via the existing rs- prefix). Add 15 checks; documented suite count
updated from the stale 137 to 1180.

